  "title": "eMudhra Certificate Authorities' Digital Certificate Leak and Government Investigation",
  "summary": "The eMudhra certificate authorities faced a security breach where weak private keys allowed website impersonation, prompting Google, Mozilla, and Cloudflare to act. A special team has been established to investigate the issue and ensure stronger cryptographic practices.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "eMudhra intermediate certificates had weak private keys that could enable website impersonation",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Google, Mozilla, and Cloudflare acted to protect internet users by blocking weakly generated keys",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "A special team has been formed to investigate the eMudhra certificate leak",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
